{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Root verification confirmed three external accuracy defects. README.md, docs/manifest-signing.md, docs/plan-review-gate.md, and shipped sign help describe HMAC-SHA256, while current ticket attestations use a DSSE envelope with an sshsig signature. README.md says the completion close gate applies to stories and epics, while src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py exempts only session_log, code_review, and identity types before evaluating ordinary closes. Shipped import help says reruns duplicate tickets and deferred push is future work, while src/rebar/_io/import_ndjson.py implements source_id idempotency, deferred push, and batched commits for independent passes."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787296851047025001,"uuid":"0ea534fe-b59e-48df-8974-90ae447cfb24"}